  "summary": "toll_free exfiltrates installer identity to webhook.site on install",
  "details": "package.json defines both preinstall and postinstall lifecycle scripts that run curl against a hardcoded webhook.site endpoint, sending the installer's username ($(whoami)), hostname ($(hostname)), current working directory ($PWD), and a timestamp as query parameters. The package ships no library or tool code — its sole install-time effect is beaconing host-identifying reconnaissance data to a third-party request-inspection service commonly used as an ad-hoc collection sink. The behavior fires automatically on npm install without user interaction.",
